<view class="page"><button class="secondary-action" bindtap="openAmbassador">申请成为推荐大使 ›</button>
  <view class="heading"><view class="page-title serif">邀请与奖励</view><view class="subtitle">分享小程序卡片，推荐来源自动带入。</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="invite-error">{{error}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{message}}" class="invite-message">{{message}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="muted">正在核对推荐信息并生成图片…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{ready}}" class="invite-preview">
    <view class="footnote">邀请朋友了解俱乐部。奖励明细及提现尚未开放，分享不代表已经取得奖励。</view><view class="section-title serif">小程序分享卡片</view>
    <image class="invite-card-image" src="{{cardPath}}" mode="widthFix" />
    <button class="primary-action" open-type="share" disabled="{{loading || saving}}">分享小程序卡片</button>
    <view class="section-title serif">介绍图片</view>
    <image class="invite-poster-image" src="{{posterPath}}" mode="widthFix" />
    <view wx:if="{{scanReady}}" class="footnote">可用微信扫描海报内的小程序码。新版发布前，开发或体验版本仅对获准体验人员开放。推荐关系不代表已取得奖励资格。</view>
    <view wx:else class="footnote">扫码入口暂未生成，请与小程序卡片配合使用。推荐关系不代表已取得奖励资格。</view>
    <button class="secondary-action" bindtap="savePoster" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{loading || saving || showPrivacy}}">保存介绍图片</button>
    <view wx:if="{{showPrivacy}}" class="card">
      <view class="section-title serif">保存图片前请确认</view>
      <view>仅在你主动保存时，将本小程序生成的俱乐部邀请介绍图片写入手机相册，方便分享。暂不授权仍可分享小程序卡片。</view>
      <button class="secondary-action" bindtap="openPosterPrivacy">阅读{{privacyContractName}}</button>
      <button id="invite-poster-privacy" data-privacy-request="{{privacyRequestId}}" open-type="agreePrivacyAuthorization" bindagreeprivacyauthorization="agreePosterPrivacy">同意并保存图片</button>
      <button class="secondary-action" bindtap="cancelPosterPrivacy">暂不授权</button>
    </view>
  </view>
  <button wx:if="{{albumDenied}}" class="secondary-action" bindtap="openSettings">打开相册权限设置</button>
  <button class="secondary-action retry-invite" bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{loading || saving || showPrivacy}}">重新生成邀请图片</button>
  <button wx:if="{{!ready && !loading}}" class="text-action" bindtap="openLogin">前往登录</button>
  <canvas type="2d" id="invite-card" class="export-canvas card-canvas"></canvas>
  <canvas type="2d" id="invite-poster" class="export-canvas poster-canvas"></canvas>
</view>
